# 行尾策略：shell 脚本与配置文件强制 LF（Android 上 CRLF 会炸）
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.prop      text eol=lf
*.service   text eol=lf
*.inotify   text eol=lf
*.md        text
LICENSE     text
customize.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止 git 做文本处理
tailscale/bin/*  binary
tailscale/lib/*  binary
META-INF/com/google/android/update-binary binary
META-INF/com/google/android/updater-script text eol=lf
